 ('VisiConsult X-ray Systems & Solutions GmbH','Master thesis — X-ray image filtering/compression','Stockelsdorf','Thesis','Data / Imaging','LIVE','Good German and English preferred','Onsite / flexible',ARRAY['Image Processing','Data Compression']::TEXT[],'https://visiconsult-x-ray-systems-solutions-gmbh.jobs.personio.de/?language=en',DATE '2026-08-30','Adjacent rather than exact; useful evidence that technical students are actively integrated.'),
 ('Basler AG','Praktikum oder Werkstudierendentätigkeit in der Forschung: Vermessung von Bildgebungskomponenten','Ahrensburg','Werkstudent / Internship','Research / Imaging','LIVE','Role-specific requirement not captured','Mix Office & Remote may vary',ARRAY['Computer Vision','Imaging']::TEXT[],'https://career.baslerweb.com/',DATE '2026-08-30','Apply if willing to pivot toward computer vision and imaging systems.'),
 ('embeff GmbH','Werkstudent Embedded Software','Lübeck','Werkstudent','Embedded / Test Automation','LIVE','German ad; CEFR not stated','Unknown',ARRAY['Embedded','Microcontrollers','Drivers','Test Automation']::TEXT[],'https://www.iti.uni-luebeck.de/fileadmin/Ausschreibungen/WerkstudentIn_EmbeddedSoftware.pdf',DATE '2026-02-28','Niche startup role; position existing testing/debugging skills as transferable.'),
 ('Obungi GmbH','Werkstudent IT Projektmanagement','Hamburg / Bremen / Lübeck','Werkstudent','Technical Project Management','LIVE','German client context likely','Partially remote',ARRAY['Cloud','Data','Analytics','AI']::TEXT[],'https://www.stepstone.de/jobs/werkstudent-it/in-l%C3%BCbeck',DATE '2026-08-16','Not coding-first, but explicitly Lübeck-compatible and close to data/cloud delivery.'),
 ('ABOUT YOU SE & Co. KG','Working Student — IT-Security','Hamburg','Working Student','IT Security','LIVE','Check official posting','Hybrid',ARRAY['IT Security','Application Security']::TEXT[],'https://jobs.smartrecruiters.com/ABOUTYOUGmbH/744000134485449-working-student-it-security-all-genders-',DATE '2026-08-01','Direct bridge from web/backend evidence into the MSc security direction.'),
