 ('HanseCom Public Transport Ticketing Solutions GmbH','Werkstudent Geoinformatik / Informatik','Hamburg','Werkstudent','GIS / Mobility Software','LIVE','German ad; verify exact requirement','Hybrid',ARRAY['GIS','Geodata','Spatial Databases','Movement Data']::TEXT[],'https://init-portal-hansecom.rexx-systems.com/Werkstudent-mwd-Geoinformatik-Informatik-de-j1157.html',DATE '2026-08-16','Highest-priority Hamburg niche role; lead with PostGIS optimization and Chargerzilla maps.'),
